This repository vendors GB10 (SM121) vLLM patches from
https://github.com/blazux/qwen3.8-Flash-DGX (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2026 blazux),
which itself incorporates contributions by @Saren-Arterius (GB10 FLA fixes,
PLE gather fast path, mamba state-copy guard, fp8 side-layer conversion),
@AndreasKaratzas (vllm#50729), @k3dani (persistent_topk diagnosis) and
@jschmied (independent reproduction, native-offload fixes, concurrency data).

Vendored files (src/, unmodified unless noted in the file header):
  vllm_ple_mmap.py, mamba_utils_guarded.py, patch_mamba_block_size.py,
  patch_qsa_exact_topk.py, vllm_fp8_hybrid_modelopt.py,
  test_ple_mmap_cpu.py, test_qsa_exact_topk_cpu.py

The multi-node launch pattern and GB10 operational discipline (unconditional
page-cache flusher, worker-first launch, image-ID verification, gate suite)
follow https://github.com/tonyd2wild/GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4-1M-KV-4x-DGX-Spark.
